131	     * environment in which t was built, whose location is that component's node (CUWrapper); or null.
132	     * A native component's object is built in an environment at its own declaration, under the
133	     * component's top level.  The linker gives one component to a name, so in a run the component's
134	     * name and the type's own name identify its declaration.
